Comment: 5,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文CN————————
Dialogue: 5,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,把暑假的時間全留給紬?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.23,0:00:09.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,雖然這是我自己擅自決定的
Dialogue: 5,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,如果可以的話  希望靜久也一起來
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.61,0:00:14.05,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不行嗎…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.05,0:00:15.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,靜久…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:15.91,0:00:16.87,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這種事…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.35,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾!?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:18.64,0:00:21.47,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,當然沒問題了
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.47,0:00:25.37,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我也會把剩餘的時間  全部留給紬的
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.70,0:00:28.11,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,最喜歡靜久了!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:28.11,0:00:29.81,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我也是哦  紬
Dialogue: 6,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.35,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾~
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.81,0:00:31.35,Text CN - Tsumugi,,800,0,0,,抱抱~
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.35,0:00:33.00,Text CN Top - Tsumugi,,500,0,30,,姆~ 姆~… 啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.20,Text CN Top - Tsumugi,,500,0,30,,姆姆~ 啾… 姆… 啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.68,Text CN Top - Tsumugi,,500,0,30,,姆~~ 啾啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.98,Text CN Top - Tsumugi,,500,0,30,,姆啾… 姆~…~
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.48,Text CN Top - Tsumugi,,500,0,30,,{\fad(0,500)}姆~ 啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.35,0:00:32.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,謝謝你  靜久
Dialogue: 5,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,要說謝謝的應該是我才對啦
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.64,0:00:36.68,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,謝謝你提出了這麼好的建議
Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.68,0:00:38.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,讓我們好好享受這個暑假吧
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.19,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好嗎  紬
Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.53,0:00:41.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 5,0:00:41.15,0:00:42.10,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.89,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆~ 啾~~~~~
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.00,0:00:49.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,於是  我們真正的暑假開始了
Comment: 5,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文CN————————
Dialogue: 4,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,夏休みを　紬に？
Dialogue: 4,0:00:06.23,0:00:09.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なんか　俺が一人で 勝手に決めちゃったけど…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,できれば　静久も一緒に…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:12.61,0:00:14.05,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だめ…　かな？
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.05,0:00:15.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,靜久…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:15.91,0:00:16.87,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そんなの…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.35,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.64,0:00:21.47,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もちろんいいに決まってるじゃないの
Dialogue: 4,0:00:21.47,0:00:25.37,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私も夏の残りの時間　全部　紬にあげるわ
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.70,0:00:28.11,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,静久　大好きです！
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.11,0:00:29.81,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私もよ　紬
Dialogue: 4,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.35,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ～！
Dialogue: 4,0:00:29.81,0:00:31.35,Text JP - Tsumugi,,800,0,0,,ぎゅ～！
Comment: 4,0:00:31.35,0:00:33.00,Text JP Top - Tsumugi,,500,0,0,,
Comment: 4,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.20,Text JP Top - Tsumugi,,500,0,0,,
Comment: 4,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.68,Text JP Top - Tsumugi,,500,0,0,,
Comment: 4,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.98,Text JP Top - Tsumugi,,500,0,0,,
Comment: 4,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.48,Text JP Top - Tsumugi,,500,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.35,0:00:32.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ありがとう　静久
Dialogue: 4,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お礼を言うのはこっちよ
Dialogue: 4,0:00:34.64,0:00:36.68,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,すてきな提案してくれて…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:36.68,0:00:38.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,思いっきり夏休みを楽しみましょう
Dialogue: 4,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.19,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ねっ　紬
Dialogue: 4,0:00:40.53,0:00:41.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あら？
Dialogue: 4,0:00:41.15,0:00:42.10,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬？
Dialogue: 4,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.89,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ～…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:46.00,0:00:49.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,こうして俺たちの　本当の夏休みが始まったんだ》
Comment: 5,0:02:20.99,0:02:20.99,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文CN  OP後————————
Dialogue: 5,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,品刻洋芋片
Dialogue: 5,0:02:23.64,0:02:25.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,還有陽台!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:25.70,0:02:28.21,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,等會  我有點沒理解你說的
Dialogue: 5,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.05,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,品刻洋芋片是
Dialogue: 5,0:02:30.05,0:02:32.61,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,之前撿垃圾時收集到的…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:32.61,0:02:33.17,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:02:33.17,0:02:36.55,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,因為不好分類  就一直放在那裡
Dialogue: 5,0:02:36.55,0:02:38.55,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但昨晚我突然想到了
Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,搭一個陽台!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:42.19,0:02:43.49,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,回收利用
Dialogue: 5,0:02:43.49,0:02:47.35,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,用品刻洋芋片的空罐搭成陽台
Dialogue: 5,0:02:49.23,0:02:50.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,為什麼是陽台呢?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:50.84,0:02:52.56,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,因為我想要一個陽台
Dialogue: 5,0:02:53.20,0:02:57.19,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但站在罐子搭的陽台上  不會散架摔下來嗎…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.19,0:02:58.93,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,沒問題的!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.97,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,品刻洋芋片是無敵的哦
Dialogue: 5,0:03:00.97,0:03:05.36,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不過要搭陽台的話  目前的罐子根本不夠吧?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:08.28,0:03:10.37,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那我先去拿過來
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.37,0:03:12.43,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,然後開作戰會議吧
Dialogue: 5,0:03:12.43,0:03:14.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,稍微等我一下下
Dialogue: 5,0:03:16.37,0:03:18.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,用品刻洋芋片罐搭陽台嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.93,0:03:21.11,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,她的腦洞可真大啊
Dialogue: 5,0:03:21.11,0:03:22.94,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真的是紬的風格呢
Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.18,0:03:27.33,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不過  我還是很難相信
Dialogue: 5,0:03:27.33,0:03:31.25,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,暑假一結束就再也見不到紬了
Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.25,0:03:35.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,總之現在  我只想將時間花在紬身上
Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.72,0:03:39.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這就是這個暑假  我想做的事情
Dialogue: 5,0:03:39.70,0:03:41.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,難道你喜歡上紬了?
Dialogue: 6,0:03:41.86,0:03:42.74,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:42.74,0:03:44.69,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,看來完全迷上她了呢
Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.69,0:03:48.83,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不知不覺 紬對你的稱呼也從「鷹原」變成「羽依里」了
Dialogue: 5,0:03:48.83,0:03:51.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你… 你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.15,0:03:55.78,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我… 我只是想讓紬更開心  僅此而已啦
Dialogue: 5,0:03:55.78,0:03:58.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,聽好了  那種心情叫做「喜歡」哦
Dialogue: 5,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.32,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,可  可是
Dialogue: 5,0:04:01.32,0:04:03.17,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這種事太突然了…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.93,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,戀愛就是這麼突然哦  乳依里
Dialogue: 5,0:04:08.09,0:04:11.03,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,果然… 是這樣嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.03,0:04:13.81,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我… 喜歡紬…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:15.69,0:04:16.94,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬!?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:17.79,0:04:22.19,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里同學 你喜歡我嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:22.19,0:04:25.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊  呃… 那個…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:25.00,0:04:25.99,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你還好嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:26.49,0:04:28.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你的樣子有點奇怪
Dialogue: 5,0:04:28.08,0:04:29.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.51,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,肯定會奇怪啊
Dialogue: 5,0:04:30.51,0:04:33.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,畢竟第一次有男生說喜歡我
Dialogue: 5,0:04:33.26,0:04:34.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,現在很害羞
Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.43,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾~!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:47.28,0:04:50.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,如果被甩了  我的歐派可以借你一用哦
Dialogue: 5,0:04:50.16,0:04:51.93,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,請盡情哭吧
Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.60,0:04:53.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不用了…
Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.13,0:05:15.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,沒事的…
Dialogue: 5,0:05:16.82,0:05:18.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,目前還沒事
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.37,0:05:23.25,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今天是海膽炒飯哦!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:25.95,0:05:27.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里同學？你有在聽嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:05:28.61,0:05:29.32,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.32,0:05:31.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我怎能沮喪
Dialogue: 5,0:05:31.02,0:05:33.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這樣只會給紬留下尷尬的回憶
Dialogue: 5,0:05:34.47,0:05:36.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,給我振作一點!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:36.02,0:05:36.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鷹原羽依里!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:38.81,0:05:41.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,早安  羽依里同學
Dialogue: 5,0:05:41.02,0:05:41.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.83,0:05:44.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾~
Dialogue: 5,0:05:44.15,0:05:46.54,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今天也是好天氣呢~
Dialogue: 5,0:05:47.47,0:05:51.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,她好像把昨天乳依里說的話  當無事發生了
Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.78,0:05:53.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,需要借歐派給你用用嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.95,0:05:58.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不用了…
Dialogue: 5,0:05:58.04,0:06:02.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,310)}姆~啾~~!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.51,0:06:06.74,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 5,0:06:06.74,0:06:07.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊咧?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.83,0:06:09.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你們好
Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.00,0:06:10.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,喲!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.80,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,水… 水織前輩!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.76,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你好啊  加納同學
Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.76,0:06:14.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.60,0:06:16.68,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,祝前輩您今天過得開心!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:16.95,0:06:18.79,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,前輩？你說靜久?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:18.79,0:06:19.44,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 5,0:06:19.44,0:06:21.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,竟敢直呼名字!?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:21.48,0:06:23.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你他媽算老幾啊!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:22.64,0:06:23.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,1200,0,,冷靜點  天善
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.98,0:06:26.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鷹原你不知道嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.70,0:06:29.61,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,水織前輩被全校學生敬仰
Dialogue: 5,0:06:29.61,0:06:31.63,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是我校的學生會長哦
Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.63,0:06:33.22,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸  真假的?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.44,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,哪有…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:34.44,0:06:37.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我只是一對歐派而已啦
Dialogue: 5,0:06:37.48,0:06:39.79,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你們看  她剛剛也說了「歐派」…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:39.79,0:06:40.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.82,0:06:42.47,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼
Dialogue: 5,0:06:42.47,0:06:46.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,水織前輩怎麼可能會說這種話
Dialogue: 5,0:06:47.79,0:06:49.79,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你就這麼想看歐派嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.79,0:06:50.54,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真沒辦法
Dialogue: 5,0:06:53.46,0:06:56.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你竟敢水織前輩面前脫衣!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:53.86,0:06:54.86,Text CN Top - Tsumugi,,400,0,0,,姆啾~
Dialogue: 5,0:06:56.00,0:06:56.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,禁止脫!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.67,0:07:05.67,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,話說回來  這個組合真少見呢
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.67,0:07:10.46,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,從沒見過紬跟水織前輩以外的人在一起
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.46,0:07:11.53,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這樣嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:07:11.53,0:07:16.11,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不過說到少見  紬本身就是稀有角色
Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.11,0:07:18.24,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,畢竟很少在島上看到她
Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.24,0:07:20.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,給人一種飄忽不定的感覺
Dialogue: 5,0:07:20.84,0:07:22.88,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真讓人放心不下啊…
Dialogue: 5,0:07:22.88,0:07:26.65,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真沒想到她會跟你在一起呢
Dialogue: 5,0:07:26.65,0:07:28.92,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你們之間發生了什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.92,0:07:30.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,沒…
Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.38,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,什麼都沒發生
Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.38,0:07:32.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,完全沒有
Dialogue: 5,0:07:32.99,0:07:34.93,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這氣氛是怎麼回事?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:35.39,0:07:36.76,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那你們今天來是有什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:07:37.16,0:07:38.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊  對了對了
Dialogue: 5,0:07:38.84,0:07:39.58,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,其實是…
Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.01,0:07:42.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,太好了呢
Dialogue: 5,0:07:42.60,0:07:45.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,大家都願意幫忙收集品刻洋芋片的空罐
Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.64,0:07:46.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.50,0:07:49.44,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,而且棉花糖還是這麼美味啊
Dialogue: 5,0:07:54.37,0:07:56.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里同學  分你一點
Dialogue: 5,0:07:57.78,0:07:59.45,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊  那個…
Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.75,0:08:00.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.76,0:08:06.96,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,來  靜久
Dialogue: 5,0:08:09.67,0:08:10.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真美味啊
Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.98,0:08:11.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,臉頰都要化掉了呢
Dialogue: 5,0:08:24.76,0:08:27.33,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,留給紬的暑假…
Dialogue: 5,0:08:27.33,0:08:30.88,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,與她一起在夏日裡尋找想做的事
Dialogue: 5,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.57,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,時間正漸漸流逝
Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.68,0:08:40.74,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,為了搭陽台  四處奔波尋找品刻洋芋片的空罐
Dialogue: 5,0:08:45.28,0:08:49.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,並同時調查  是否有人知道紬所哼唱的小調
Dialogue: 5,0:08:51.88,0:08:53.59,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:08:57.76,0:09:00.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,謝謝你啊  加納同學
Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.10,0:09:02.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.93,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,感謝您的誇獎!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:04.99,0:09:07.12,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,除此之外  還做了很多的事
Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.16,0:09:12.56,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我們三人的快樂時光
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.64,0:09:19.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,400)}獨屬於我們的
Dialogue: 5,0:09:21.00,0:09:23.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,400)}這份特別的暑假
Dialogue: 5,0:09:23.69,0:09:26.52,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1200)}正不斷流逝
Dialogue: 5,0:09:30.32,0:09:32.46,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你好  西瓜冰棒小姐
Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.46,0:09:34.44,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊… 棉花糖妹妹
Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.44,0:09:36.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你好啊  鳴瀨同學
Dialogue: 5,0:09:36.77,0:09:37.38,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.93,0:09:38.71,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.71,0:09:40.12,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,平時的伴手禮
Dialogue: 5,0:09:42.00,0:09:42.88,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.67,0:09:44.31,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,怎麼了?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:44.31,0:09:48.29,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,有點意外啊… 紬和白羽居然認識
Dialogue: 5,0:09:48.29,0:09:51.65,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我和西瓜冰棒小姐是在這裡認識的
Dialogue: 5,0:09:52.00,0:09:54.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,現在重現一下初次相遇的那天吧
Dialogue: 5,0:09:59.40,0:10:00.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,能釣上來嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:00.60,0:10:00.95,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:01.24,0:10:02.33,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,能釣上魚嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.33,0:10:04.49,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊  那個…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:04.84,0:10:06.25,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,還好吧
Dialogue: 5,0:10:06.55,0:10:09.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那是魚的名字嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.04,0:10:12.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不  那是還好的意思
Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.15,0:10:13.25,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.07,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,釣上的魚會吃掉嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.07,0:10:19.11,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,會吃掉
Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.11,0:10:20.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.48,0:10:23.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那你覺得最好吃的東西是什麼呢?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.84,0:10:25.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,西瓜冰棒
Dialogue: 5,0:10:25.30,0:10:26.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸  那個能釣上嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.98,0:10:28.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,釣不上
Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.06,0:10:29.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,小賣鋪有賣
Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,也是呢
Dialogue: 5,0:10:31.18,0:10:33.57,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我最喜歡吃棉花糖了
Dialogue: 5,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:10:40.78,0:10:44.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我想吃西瓜冰棒了
Dialogue: 5,0:10:44.20,0:10:47.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我也是  想吃棉花糖了
Dialogue: 5,0:10:49.26,0:10:51.78,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,就這樣  我們成為了好朋友
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.78,0:10:54.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我有時會帶西瓜冰棒過來
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.84,0:10:57.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,很感謝你送我西瓜冰棒
Dialogue: 5,0:10:58.84,0:11:02.17,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真沒想到啊  還能這樣進行交流
Dialogue: 5,0:11:02.17,0:11:03.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,看起來是的
Dialogue: 5,0:11:03.26,0:11:05.85,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是的  我們是永遠的好朋友了
Dialogue: 5,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.87,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,才  才不是什麼永遠的好朋友
Dialogue: 5,0:11:07.87,0:11:08.54,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:09.57,0:11:11.11,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,品刻洋芋片
Dialogue: 5,0:11:11.11,0:11:13.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我家沒這種東西
Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這樣啊…
Dialogue: 5,0:11:15.34,0:11:19.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不過  如果哪天想吃了的話  會把空罐子給你的
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.64,0:11:21.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:21.60,0:11:23.11,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,謝謝你!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,謝謝你  白羽
Dialogue: 5,0:11:27.81,0:11:29.76,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,又不是為了幫你
Dialogue: 5,0:11:32.30,0:11:33.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,話是這麼說
Dialogue: 5,0:11:41.54,0:11:43.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,打擾一下~
Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.26,0:11:46.38,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  品刻洋芋片賣光了
Dialogue: 5,0:11:46.38,0:11:48.57,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不  我們今天來不為此事
Dialogue: 5,0:11:48.57,0:11:49.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,請來一根棉花糖
Dialogue: 5,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.89,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個  我想想…
Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.89,0:11:53.59,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我叫空門蒼!
Comment: 5,0:11:53.70,0:11:56.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,空·門·蒼
Dialogue: 5,0:11:53.92,0:11:54.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,850,1080)}空·門·蒼
Dialogue: 5,0:11:54.30,0:11:54.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,905,1080)}空·門·蒼
Dialogue: 5,0:11:54.64,0:11:55.03,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,960,1080)}空·門·蒼
Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.03,0:11:55.43,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,1016,1080)}空·門·蒼
Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.43,0:11:55.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,1070,1080)}空·門·蒼
Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.82,0:11:56.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,空·門·蒼
Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.15,0:11:58.44,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我的名字應該還記得吧?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:58.72,0:11:59.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我想想…
Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.09,0:12:02.52,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,裸~ 著~ 的~ 人~
Dialogue: 5,0:12:02.52,0:12:04.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那可不是名字啊
Dialogue: 5,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,空~ 門~ 蒼~
Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.82,0:12:07.99,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,被捲進來了
Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.99,0:12:09.21,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.37,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,蒼同學
Dialogue: 5,0:12:10.37,0:12:11.66,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,甚至還記住了
Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.20,0:12:13.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嘭!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:14.50,0:12:15.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯哼!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.62,0:12:19.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,乳依里  過來一下
Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.95,0:12:23.05,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,送禮物？給紬的?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:23.46,0:12:25.85,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這太不好吧  我都被甩了
Dialogue: 5,0:12:25.85,0:12:27.32,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,可能都沒當回事
Dialogue: 5,0:12:27.32,0:12:30.56,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,在這種時候  應該坦誠面對自己的心意
Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.56,0:12:33.91,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,把雙手放在歐派  仔細聆聽它的聲音
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.91,0:12:38.58,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,而且  暑假一結束可就要與紬分別了哦
Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.02,0:12:48.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,所以我覺得  至少留下一些這個暑假的回憶
Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.23,0:12:51.62,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但這裡能有什麼禮物…
Dialogue: 5,0:12:51.62,0:12:53.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這裡什麼都有哦
Dialogue: 5,0:12:54.69,0:12:56.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你好啊  婆婆
Dialogue: 5,0:13:13.13,0:13:17.28,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里同學 靜久  你們剛剛在聊什麼啊?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:18.02,0:13:19.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,沒… 沒有在聊什麼
Dialogue: 5,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:13:21.06,0:13:22.27,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好可疑啊
Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.27,0:13:25.67,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好了  紬  接下來你想做什麼呢?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.67,0:13:26.53,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,想好了
Dialogue: 5,0:13:26.53,0:13:28.89,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我想去羽依里同學的家裡
Dialogue: 5,0:13:28.89,0:13:29.97,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,去我家?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:29.97,0:13:32.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,剛剛蒼同學…
Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.48,0:13:35.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,若想和喜歡的人更加親近
Dialogue: 5,0:13:35.18,0:13:38.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不妨火速去對方的房間吧
Dialogue: 5,0:13:39.24,0:13:41.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,說不定還有藏起來的小黃書哦
Dialogue: 5,0:13:42.10,0:13:42.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這麼說的
Dialogue: 5,0:13:45.82,0:13:50.09,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,可是突然來我家  不知道鏡子阿姨有沒有意見
Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.09,0:13:51.19,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 5,0:13:51.19,0:13:52.92,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,歡迎你們
Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.92,0:13:55.35,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里同學平日承蒙二位照顧了
Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.65,0:13:57.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,感謝你們的歡迎
Dialogue: 5,0:13:57.64,0:13:59.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,彼此彼此  我們也承蒙他照顧了
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.76,0:14:01.72,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,過來  過來
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.92,0:14:06.42,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,所以是哪位上次邀請你去過夜的?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.23,0:14:08.93,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是金髮那位
Dialogue: 5,0:14:08.93,0:14:11.03,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不過實際上  我們是三人一起過夜
Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.25,0:14:13.62,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,腳踏兩條船!?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:13.62,0:14:14.52,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這件事
Dialogue: 5,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,必須跟姐姐說才行
Dialogue: 6,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,120,,{\fs40}你媽媽
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.54,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,求你了  別打過去!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.48,0:14:23.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這裡就是羽依里同學的房間嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.32,0:14:25.76,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾~
Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.76,0:14:27.63,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,有點小激動呢
Dialogue: 5,0:14:27.63,0:14:32.01,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,雖說這是我的房間  但只是這個夏天暫住在這裡
Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.98,0:14:35.10,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,看來乳依里很懂呢~
Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.06,0:14:39.96,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:40.76,0:14:43.52,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不  這東西是我朋友塞給我的
Dialogue: 5,0:14:44.71,0:14:47.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,乳依里  你能先在外面等會嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.72,0:14:53.88,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好了哦
Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.36,0:14:56.87,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.00,0:15:00.66,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾~
Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.66,0:15:02.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,感覺硬邦邦的…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:02.34,0:15:04.17,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣啊  羽依里同學
Dialogue: 5,0:15:04.17,0:15:05.75,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,就算問我怎麼樣…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.97,0:15:08.13,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,裡面是不是塞了什麼
Dialogue: 5,0:15:08.80,0:15:09.72,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.65,0:15:11.58,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:14.02,0:15:15.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾~
Dialogue: 5,0:15:17.52,0:15:18.39,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,哎呀~
Dialogue: 5,0:15:18.39,0:15:20.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,打擾一下
Dialogue: 5,0:15:23.01,0:15:25.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,果然還得跟姐姐說才行
Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.06,0:15:26.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,都說了 求你別打!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.71,0:15:31.74,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,找到了找到了
Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.12,0:15:32.68,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.99,0:15:38.38,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這是童謠集
Dialogue: 5,0:15:38.38,0:15:41.72,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我聽說小紬在找以前的歌
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.72,0:15:44.25,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,所以我想這本書或許有用
Dialogue: 5,0:15:44.25,0:15:46.22,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,謝謝你  鏡子阿姨
Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.99,0:15:49.17,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這本書裡或許有紬所哼的歌
Dialogue: 5,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,看不懂
Dialogue: 5,0:15:54.34,0:15:56.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好像是德語呢
Dialogue: 5,0:15:56.26,0:15:58.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,完全看不懂的說
Dialogue: 5,0:15:58.82,0:16:00.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,能讓我看看嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:16:10.93,0:16:11.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這就是…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.82,0:16:14.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯  這是我最喜歡的那首歌
Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.86,0:16:17.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,終於找到了呢  紬
Dialogue: 5,0:16:20.23,0:16:21.56,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.56,0:16:24.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這樣根本不知道該怎麼唱
Dialogue: 5,0:16:25.46,0:16:28.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那就讓紬來寫歌詞吧
Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.47,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.47,0:16:30.74,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,感覺很有趣呢
Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.74,0:16:31.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我們來試試吧
Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.70,0:16:32.46,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:32.46,0:16:35.22,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不過  感覺有點難
Dialogue: 5,0:16:35.22,0:16:38.54,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那就先說說你自己喜歡的東西吧
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.54,0:16:40.67,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,一定能寫出專屬於紬的歌詞
Dialogue: 5,0:16:40.67,0:16:43.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,喜歡的… 東西嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.50,0:16:48.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,840,0,0,,姆啾啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.56,0:16:53.99,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真的真的非常感謝
Dialogue: 5,0:16:53.99,0:16:55.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,哪裡哪裡
Dialogue: 5,0:16:55.02,0:16:56.85,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,只要能幫上忙就好
Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.85,0:16:58.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,歡迎再來玩呀
Dialogue: 5,0:16:58.26,0:16:58.91,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 5,0:16:58.91,0:17:00.57,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那麼回去路上小心哦
Dialogue: 5,0:17:00.57,0:17:01.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,謝謝關心
Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.13,0:17:06.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,乳依里  如果今晚睡得不好的話  真不好意思
Dialogue: 5,0:17:06.54,0:17:07.55,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,什麼意思?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.55,0:17:09.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,剛剛紬的歐派
Dialogue: 5,0:17:09.30,0:17:13.42,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,因為沒找到合適的填充物  就塞了乳依里的枕頭
Dialogue: 5,0:17:14.50,0:17:16.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我的枕頭?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.67,0:17:19.36,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,塞進了紬的… 胸裡?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:22.86,0:17:24.77,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,給我振作點！鷹原羽依里!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:28.34,0:17:31.65,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,加油啊！紬文德斯!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:31.65,0:17:32.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.88,0:17:37.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,歐派！水織靜久!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.42,0:17:46.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鷹原！{\alpha&HFF&\t(1350,1351,\alpha&H00&)}羽依{\fs64\t(1650,3220,\fs110)}裡!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:45.73,0:17:48.65,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,1000,0,,紬文德斯!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.12,0:17:50.67,Text CN - Tsumugi,,1100,0,0,,水織靜久!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.67,0:17:53.24,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鷹原！{\alpha&HFF&\t(1190,1191,\alpha&H00&)}羽依{\fs64\t(1500,3500,\fs180)}裡!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:53.24,0:17:56.10,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬文德斯!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.10,0:17:59.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}水織靜久!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:08.78,0:18:09.77,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好嚇人…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.11,0:18:13.65,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊  果然是那位哼歌的大姐姐!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:15.44,0:18:16.57,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,大家…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.36,0:18:19.28,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,給你!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:23.53,0:18:26.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,要是靜久也能一起來就好了
Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.70,0:18:28.24,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是  是啊
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.24,0:18:30.63,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今天我要早點回家
Dialogue: 5,0:18:30.63,0:18:32.21,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,接下來交給你們了 好嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:18:32.63,0:18:35.09,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,她在瞎顧慮什麼啊
Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.87,0:18:37.55,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.24,0:18:42.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,要不要上燈塔看看?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:45.24,0:18:48.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬平時都在看這麼美的風景啊
Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.62,0:18:49.74,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.74,0:18:52.19,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我最喜歡這裡的風景了
Dialogue: 5,0:19:04.52,0:19:05.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.32,0:19:08.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我終於做好了
Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.60,0:19:09.94,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,內心的準備
Dialogue: 5,0:19:10.84,0:19:12.10,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,內心的準備?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:12.66,0:19:14.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那  那個啊…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:15.00,0:19:16.80,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我也很喜歡哦
Dialogue: 5,0:19:16.80,0:19:18.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,喜歡羽依里
Dialogue: 5,0:19:18.16,0:19:18.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.04,0:19:21.23,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我之前應該說過喜歡
Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.23,0:19:23.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是超喜歡的…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:23.26,0:19:25.43,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那不是朋友之間的喜歡嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:19:25.82,0:19:27.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那時候確實是的
Dialogue: 5,0:19:28.67,0:19:29.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 5,0:19:31.18,0:19:33.14,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那也有其他的意思
Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.21,0:19:38.12,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,從你說把「暑假剩餘的時間全部留給我」的那時起
Dialogue: 5,0:19:38.12,0:19:40.10,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,當時你都這麼對我說了
Dialogue: 5,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.32,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那我肯定喜歡上你了啊
Dialogue: 5,0:19:42.32,0:19:45.69,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,所以啊  為了不讓自己心動
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.69,0:19:49.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我一直在羽依里面前  裝作很平靜的樣子
Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.85,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但完全做不到
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.85,0:19:55.33,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,直到現在  我仍心跳不已
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.57,0:19:56.52,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.32,0:20:00.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但是… 我差不多就要回去了
Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.62,0:20:04.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,所以說喜歡什麼的
Dialogue: 5,0:20:04.08,0:20:05.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,已經毫無意義了
Dialogue: 5,0:20:11.35,0:20:15.54,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,在分別的那一天  我肯定會痛哭流涕的
Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.55,0:20:20.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我不想就這樣和你分別
Dialogue: 5,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.94,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,為什麼啊?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.94,0:20:22.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:23.68,0:20:26.87,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,為什麼… 你要說出來呢?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.56,0:20:34.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,因為知道要分別了
Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.34,0:20:36.96,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,所以就毫無意義嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.60,0:20:38.38,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:39.08,0:20:41.42,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,即便知道我們今後會分別
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.42,0:20:44.39,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,即便知道會再也見不了面
Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.39,0:20:47.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這份心意就毫無意義了嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:20:47.34,0:20:48.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但我並不這樣認為
Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.66,0:20:51.76,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,無論會發生多麼艱苦的事
Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.76,0:20:53.66,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,喜歡的心意是永不改變的
Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.71,0:20:57.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是紬讓我想起了這件事哦
Dialogue: 5,0:20:58.13,0:20:59.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:00.03,0:21:00.80,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.62,0:21:04.44,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,所以  我還是會說出來的
Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.33,0:21:07.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬  我喜歡你
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.19,0:21:10.24,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.95,0:21:12.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 5,0:21:16.52,0:21:19.79,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我最喜歡羽依里了
Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.41,0:21:29.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鏡子阿姨  我回來了
Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.00,0:21:31.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.67,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里  你看起來很開心呢
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.67,0:21:37.77,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這… 這樣嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:21:44.40,0:21:45.51,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我也來幫忙吧
Dialogue: 5,0:21:46.46,0:21:47.44,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊  抱歉
Dialogue: 5,0:21:53.56,0:21:54.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:02.63,0:22:09.83,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fad(0,1780)}那晚之後  紬從我們面前消失了
Comment: 4,0:02:20.99,0:02:20.99,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文JP  OP後————————
Dialogue: 4,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パリングルスです
Dialogue: 4,0:02:23.64,0:02:25.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そして　ベランダです！
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.70,0:02:28.21,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちょっと　話が見えないんだけど
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.05,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パリングルスって
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.05,0:02:32.61,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,この前のゴミ集めで見つけた…
Dialogue: 4,0:02:32.61,0:02:33.17,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい！
Dialogue: 4,0:02:33.17,0:02:36.55,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,分別ができなくて　ずっと捨てられませんでしたが
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.55,0:02:38.55,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,昨日の夜ひらめいたんです
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ベランダを作ろうと！
Dialogue: 4,0:02:42.19,0:02:43.49,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,リサイクルです
Dialogue: 4,0:02:43.49,0:02:47.35,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パリングルスの空き容器が　ベランダへと生まれ変わるのです！
Dialogue: 4,0:02:49.23,0:02:50.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どうしてベランダなんだ？
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.84,0:02:52.56,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ベランダが欲しいからです
Dialogue: 4,0:02:53.20,0:02:57.19,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも　そんなのに乗ったら　壊れて落ちちゃうんじゃ…
Dialogue: 4,0:02:57.19,0:02:58.93,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,大丈夫です！
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.97,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パリングルスはムテキです
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.97,0:03:05.36,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも　ベランダを作るんだったら　だいぶ数が足りないんじゃないかしら？
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.28,0:03:10.37,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,じゃあ　今　持ってきますから
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.37,0:03:12.43,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,作戦会議をしましょう
Dialogue: 4,0:03:12.43,0:03:14.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちょっと待っててください
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.37,0:03:18.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パリングルスでベランダか…
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.93,0:03:21.11,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,とんでもないことを思いつくな
Dialogue: 4,0:03:21.11,0:03:22.94,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ホント紬らしいわね
Dialogue: 4,0:03:24.18,0:03:27.33,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも　まだ信じられないわ
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.33,0:03:31.25,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,夏が終わったら　紬と会えなくなっちゃうだなんて
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.25,0:03:35.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,とにかく今は　紬のために時間を使いたい
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.72,0:03:39.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それが今年の夏　俺のやりたいことになったんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:03:39.70,0:03:41.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好きになっちゃった？　紬のこと
Dialogue: 4,0:03:41.86,0:03:42.74,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ？
Dialogue: 4,0:03:42.74,0:03:44.69,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,すっかりメロメロね
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.69,0:03:48.83,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬もいつの間にか　「タカハラさん」から　「ハイリさん」になってるし
Dialogue: 4,0:03:48.83,0:03:51.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,な…　何言ってんだよ？
Dialogue: 4,0:03:51.15,0:03:55.78,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お…　俺は　ただ　紬が喜んでくれればって　それだけで
Dialogue: 4,0:03:55.78,0:03:58.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あのね　その気持ちを「好き」っていうのよ
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.32,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,で　でも
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.32,0:04:03.17,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そんなこといきなり…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.93,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,恋はいつもいきなりなの　ハイリくん！
Dialogue: 4,0:04:08.09,0:04:11.03,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,やっぱり　そうなのか？
Dialogue: 4,0:04:11.03,0:04:13.81,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺　紬のことが　好き…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.69,0:04:16.94,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬!?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.79,0:04:22.19,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさん　私のことが　好きなんですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.19,0:04:25.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あっ　えっ…　えっと…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.00,0:04:25.99,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,大丈夫？
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.49,0:04:28.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,様子がおかしいけど
Dialogue: 4,0:04:28.08,0:04:29.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.51,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,おかしくもなります
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.51,0:04:33.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,男の人に初めて好きと言われました
Dialogue: 4,0:04:33.26,0:04:34.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,照れてます
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.43,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ～っ！！
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.28,0:04:50.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,フラれちゃったら　おっぱい貸してあげるから
Dialogue: 4,0:04:50.16,0:04:51.93,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,思い切り泣いていいわよ
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.60,0:04:53.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,遠慮しとく…
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.13,0:05:15.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,大丈夫…
Dialogue: 4,0:05:16.82,0:05:18.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,まだ　大丈夫です
Dialogue: 4,0:05:21.37,0:05:23.25,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今日はウニチャーハンです！
Dialogue: 4,0:05:25.95,0:05:27.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,聞いてます？　羽依里さん
Dialogue: 4,0:05:28.61,0:05:29.32,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いや
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.32,0:05:31.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,落ち込んでどうする？
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.02,0:05:33.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,これじゃ　紬に気まずい思いをさせるだけだぞ
Dialogue: 4,0:05:34.47,0:05:36.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,シャンとしろ！
Dialogue: 4,0:05:36.02,0:05:36.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鷹原羽依里！
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.81,0:05:41.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,おはようございます！　ハイリさん！
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.02,0:05:41.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ？
Dialogue: 4,0:05:42.83,0:05:44.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ～
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.15,0:05:46.54,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今日もいい天気ですね～
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.47,0:05:51.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,昨日のハイリくんのあれ　なかったことになってるみたいね
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.78,0:05:53.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,おっぱい　貸しましょうか？
Dialogue: 4,0:05:56.95,0:05:58.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いい…
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.04,0:06:02.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,310)}むぎゅ～！
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.51,0:06:06.74,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いらっしゃ～い！
Dialogue: 4,0:06:06.74,0:06:07.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あれ？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.83,0:06:09.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,こんにちはです
Dialogue: 4,0:06:09.00,0:06:10.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,よっ！
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.80,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,み…　水織先輩！
Dialogue: 4,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.76,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ごきげんよう　加納くん
Dialogue: 4,0:06:13.76,0:06:14.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい！
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.60,0:06:16.68,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,先輩もご機嫌うるわしく！
Dialogue: 4,0:06:16.95,0:06:18.79,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,先輩？　静久が？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:18.79,0:06:19.44,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,イテッ！
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.44,0:06:21.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ファーストネーム呼びだと？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.48,0:06:23.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,貴様　何様のつもりだ！
Dialogue: 3,0:06:22.64,0:06:23.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,1200,0,,落ち着くんだ　天善！
Dialogue: 4,0:06:23.98,0:06:26.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鷹原　お前知らなかったのか？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:26.70,0:06:29.61,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,水織先輩は　全校の人望も厚い
Dialogue: 4,0:06:29.61,0:06:31.63,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我が校の生徒会長だぞ
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.63,0:06:33.22,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ　マジで？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.44,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そんな…
Dialogue: 4,0:06:34.44,0:06:37.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私は　ただ　一房のおっぱいにすぎないわ
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.48,0:06:39.79,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ほら　今も「おっぱい」って…
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.79,0:06:40.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はぁ？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:40.82,0:06:42.47,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,何を言っているんだ？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.47,0:06:46.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,水織先輩が　そんなふざけたことを　言うわけないだろ
Dialogue: 4,0:06:47.79,0:06:49.79,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そんなにおっぱいが見たいのか？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:49.79,0:06:50.54,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,しかたない！
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.46,0:06:56.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,水織先輩の前でなんて格好を！
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.86,0:06:54.86,Text JP Top - Tsumugi,,400,0,0,,むぎゅ
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.00,0:06:56.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,脱ぐな！
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.67,0:07:05.67,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それにしても　珍しい組み合わせね
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.67,0:07:10.46,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今まで紬が水織先輩以外の人と一緒にいるのを　見たことなかったわ
Dialogue: 4,0:07:10.46,0:07:11.53,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そうなんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:07:11.53,0:07:16.11,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,まっ　珍しいといえば　紬自体がレアキャラみたいなもんだけど
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.11,0:07:18.24,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,島でもあまり見かけないからね
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.24,0:07:20.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬って　いつもフワフワしてて
Dialogue: 4,0:07:20.84,0:07:22.88,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なんだか放っておけないっていうか…
Dialogue: 4,0:07:22.88,0:07:26.65,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それが　よりによって　アンタとご同伴だなんてね～
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.65,0:07:28.92,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いったい何があったんだか～
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.92,0:07:30.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いや…
Dialogue: 4,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.38,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,何もないから
Dialogue: 4,0:07:31.38,0:07:32.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,全然
Dialogue: 4,0:07:32.99,0:07:34.93,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なんなの？　その空気…
Dialogue: 4,0:07:35.39,0:07:36.76,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,で　今日は何？
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.16,0:07:38.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あぁ　そうだった
Dialogue: 4,0:07:38.84,0:07:39.58,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,実は…
Dialogue: 4,0:07:41.01,0:07:42.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,よかったわね
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.60,0:07:45.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パリングルス集め　みんなも協力してくれるって
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.64,0:07:46.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 4,0:07:46.50,0:07:49.44,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それにわたあめも相変わらずおいしいです
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.37,0:07:56.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさん　おすそわけです
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.78,0:07:59.45,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あっ　えっと…
Dialogue: 4,0:07:59.75,0:08:00.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.76,0:08:06.96,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい　シズク
Dialogue: 4,0:08:09.67,0:08:10.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,おいしい
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.98,0:08:11.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だな
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ほっぺた落ちちゃいますね
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.76,0:08:27.33,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬にあげた夏休みは…
Dialogue: 4,0:08:27.33,0:08:30.88,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,彼女のやりたいことを探す夏の日々は
Dialogue: 4,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.57,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,こうして過ぎていった
Dialogue: 4,0:08:36.68,0:08:40.74,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ベランダ作りのために　パリングルスの空き容器を集めたり…
Dialogue: 4,0:08:45.28,0:08:49.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬の鼻歌について　誰か知ってる人はいないか調べたり…
Dialogue: 4,0:08:51.88,0:08:53.59,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ～
Dialogue: 4,0:08:57.76,0:09:00.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ありがとう　加納く～ん！
Dialogue: 4,0:09:01.10,0:09:02.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい！
Dialogue: 4,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.93,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ありがたきお言葉！
Dialogue: 4,0:09:04.99,0:09:07.12,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,その他にも　いろんなことをして…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.16,0:09:12.56,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,3人の楽しい時間が…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.64,0:09:19.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,400)}俺たちだけの
Dialogue: 4,0:09:21.00,0:09:23.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,400)}特別な夏休みが
Dialogue: 4,0:09:23.69,0:09:26.52,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1200)}過ぎていった
Dialogue: 4,0:09:30.32,0:09:32.46,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,こんにちは　スイカバーさん
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.46,0:09:34.44,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あ…　わたあめさん
Dialogue: 4,0:09:34.44,0:09:36.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,こんにちは　鳴瀬さん
Dialogue: 4,0:09:36.77,0:09:37.38,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ども…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.93,0:09:38.71,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 4,0:09:38.71,0:09:40.12,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いつものお土産です
Dialogue: 4,0:09:42.00,0:09:42.88,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ありがと…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:43.67,0:09:44.31,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なに？
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.31,0:09:48.29,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,意外だな…　紬としろはが知り合いだなんて
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.29,0:09:51.65,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,スイカバーさんとは　ここで知り合いになったんです
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.00,0:09:54.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今から出会った日を再現してみましょう
Dialogue: 4,0:09:59.40,0:10:00.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,釣れますか？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.60,0:10:00.95,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.24,0:10:02.33,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,釣れますか？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.33,0:10:04.49,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あっ　えと…
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.84,0:10:06.25,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ぼちぼちです
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.55,0:10:09.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それは　魚の名前ですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:09.04,0:10:12.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いいえ　それなりという意味です
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.15,0:10:13.25,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そですか
Dialogue: 4,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.07,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,釣ったら食べるんですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:18.07,0:10:19.11,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,食べます
Dialogue: 4,0:10:19.11,0:10:20.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そですか
Dialogue: 4,0:10:20.48,0:10:23.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あなたがいちばんおいしいと思うものは何ですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:23.84,0:10:25.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,スイカバーです
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.30,0:10:26.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ　釣れるんですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.98,0:10:28.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,釣れません
Dialogue: 4,0:10:28.06,0:10:29.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,駄菓子屋にあります
Dialogue: 4,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そですね
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.18,0:10:33.57,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私はわたあめが好きです
Dialogue: 4,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そうですか
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.78,0:10:44.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,スイカバー　食べたくなってきた
Dialogue: 4,0:10:44.20,0:10:47.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私も　わたあめが食べたいですｓ
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.26,0:10:51.78,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,こんな感じで仲よくなりました
Dialogue: 4,0:10:51.78,0:10:54.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,時々　スイカバーを持ってきます
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.84,0:10:57.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,スイカバーは感謝してる
Dialogue: 4,0:10:58.84,0:11:02.17,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なんか　コミュニケーションとれてるんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:11:02.17,0:11:03.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,みたいね
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.26,0:11:05.85,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい　今ではズッ友です！
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.87,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ず…　ズッ友違うし…
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.87,0:11:08.54,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ？
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.57,0:11:11.11,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パリングルス
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.11,0:11:13.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そういうのうちにはないから
Dialogue: 4,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そですか…
Dialogue: 4,0:11:15.34,0:11:19.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あっ　でも　もしも食べることがあったら　空き容器持っていくから
Dialogue: 4,0:11:20.64,0:11:21.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ！
Dialogue: 4,0:11:21.60,0:11:23.11,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ありがとうございます！
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,うんありがとう　しろは
Dialogue: 4,0:11:27.81,0:11:29.76,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,別にあなたのためじゃないし
Dialogue: 4,0:11:32.30,0:11:33.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それはそうだけど
Dialogue: 4,0:11:41.54,0:11:43.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ごめんくださ～い！
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.26,0:11:46.38,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ごめん　パリングルス売り切れちゃってるんだけど
Dialogue: 4,0:11:46.38,0:11:48.57,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いや　今日はそっちじゃなくて
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.57,0:11:49.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,わたあめください
Dialogue: 4,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.89,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっと　えっと…
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.89,0:11:53.59,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,空門蒼よ！
Comment: 4,0:11:53.70,0:11:56.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そ　ら　か　ど　あ　お！
Dialogue: 4,0:11:53.92,0:11:54.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,850,1080)}そら　かど　あお
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.30,0:11:54.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,905,1080)}そら　かど　あお
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.64,0:11:55.03,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,960,1080)}そら　かど　あお
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.03,0:11:55.43,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,1016,1080)}そら　かど　あお
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.43,0:11:55.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,1070,1080)}そら　かど　あお
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.82,0:11:56.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そら　かど　あお
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.15,0:11:58.44,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺の名前はちゃんと覚えてるよな？
Dialogue: 4,0:11:58.72,0:11:59.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっと…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:00.09,0:12:02.52,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,「は　だ　か　の　ひと」
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.52,0:12:04.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それは名前じゃねえよ！
Dialogue: 4,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,「そ　ら　か　ど　あお」
Dialogue: 4,0:12:06.82,0:12:07.99,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,巻き込まれた！
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.99,0:12:09.21,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なるほど
Dialogue: 4,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.37,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,アオさん！
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.37,0:12:11.66,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,しかも覚えられた！
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.20,0:12:13.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ポン！
Dialogue: 4,0:12:14.50,0:12:15.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,エッヘン！
Dialogue: 4,0:12:17.62,0:12:19.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パイリくん　ちょっと…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.95,0:12:23.05,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,プレゼント？　紬に？
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.46,0:12:25.85,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いやいや　俺もうフラれたっていうか
Dialogue: 4,0:12:25.85,0:12:27.32,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,相手にもされてないし
Dialogue: 4,0:12:27.32,0:12:30.56,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,こういうのは　自分の気持ちに正直なのが一番よ
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.56,0:12:33.91,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,自分のおっぱいに手を当てて　聞いてごらんなさい
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.91,0:12:38.58,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それに　夏休みが終わったら　紬と離れ離れになっちゃうのよ
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.02,0:12:48.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だったらせめて　この夏のことを思い出せるものがあったほうがいいと思うの
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.23,0:12:51.62,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも　こんなとこでプレゼントって…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.62,0:12:53.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ここにゃあ　なんでもあるでのう
Dialogue: 4,0:12:54.69,0:12:56.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,こんにちは　おばあちゃん
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.13,0:13:17.28,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさん　シズク　さっきは何をお話ししてたんですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.02,0:13:19.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,べ…　別に何も…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:21.06,0:13:22.27,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,怪しいです
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.27,0:13:25.67,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,さぁ　紬　次は何をしたいかしら？
Dialogue: 4,0:13:25.67,0:13:26.53,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい！
Dialogue: 4,0:13:26.53,0:13:28.89,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさんのお家に行ってみたいです！
Dialogue: 4,0:13:28.89,0:13:29.97,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺の家？
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.97,0:13:32.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,さっきアオさんが言ってました
Dialogue: 4,0:13:32.48,0:13:35.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,気になる子ともっと仲よくなりたかったら
Dialogue: 4,0:13:35.18,0:13:38.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,相手の部屋に行くってのが手っ取り早いやり方ね
Dialogue: 4,0:13:39.24,0:13:41.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,隠してる　エッチな本とか見つけられるしね
Dialogue: 4,0:13:42.10,0:13:42.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,って…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:45.82,0:13:50.09,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あっ　でも　いきなり押しかけたら　鏡子さんが何て言うか…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:50.09,0:13:51.19,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,まぁ
Dialogue: 4,0:13:51.19,0:13:52.92,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ようこそいらっしゃいませ
Dialogue: 4,0:13:52.92,0:13:55.35,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里さんがいつもお世話になってます！
Dialogue: 4,0:13:55.65,0:13:57.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ご丁寧にどうもです
Dialogue: 4,0:13:57.64,0:13:59.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,こちらこそ　お世話になってます
Dialogue: 4,0:14:00.76,0:14:01.72,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちょいちょい
Dialogue: 4,0:14:02.92,0:14:06.42,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それで　この前のお泊まりはどっちの子に招待されたの？
Dialogue: 4,0:14:07.23,0:14:08.93,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,金髪の子ですけど
Dialogue: 4,0:14:08.93,0:14:11.03,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,実際　止まったのは3人一緒で
Dialogue: 4,0:14:12.25,0:14:13.62,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,二股!?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:13.62,0:14:14.52,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それは
Dialogue: 4,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お姉さんに連絡しないと…
Dialogue: 4,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.54,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お願いだから　やめてください！
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.48,0:14:23.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ここがハイリさんの部屋ですか
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.32,0:14:25.76,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ～
Dialogue: 4,0:14:25.76,0:14:27.63,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちょっとドキドキします
Dialogue: 4,0:14:27.63,0:14:32.01,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺の部屋っていっても　この夏使わせてもらってるだけだし…
Dialogue: 4,0:14:32.98,0:14:35.10,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パイリくんもわかってるわね～
Dialogue: 4,0:14:39.06,0:14:39.96,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ？
Dialogue: 4,0:14:40.76,0:14:43.52,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いや　これは　友達に無理やり渡されて…
Dialogue: 4,0:14:44.71,0:14:47.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パイリくん　ちょっと外に出てくれる？
Dialogue: 4,0:14:52.72,0:14:53.88,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いいわよ～！
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.36,0:14:56.87,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ？
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.00,0:15:00.66,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ～
Dialogue: 4,0:15:00.66,0:15:02.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ごわごわします…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:02.34,0:15:04.17,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どうですか　ハイリさん
Dialogue: 4,0:15:04.17,0:15:05.75,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ど…　どうって
Dialogue: 4,0:15:06.97,0:15:08.13,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,何か入ってる
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.80,0:15:09.72,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:10.65,0:15:11.58,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.02,0:15:15.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ～
Dialogue: 4,0:15:17.52,0:15:18.39,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あら～
Dialogue: 4,0:15:18.39,0:15:20.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちょっといいかしら？
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.01,0:15:25.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,やっぱりお姉さんに連絡を…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:25.06,0:15:26.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だから　やめてください！！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:30.71,0:15:31.74,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あったあった
Dialogue: 4,0:15:32.12,0:15:32.68,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.99,0:15:38.38,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,童謡集
Dialogue: 4,0:15:38.38,0:15:41.72,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬ちゃん　昔の歌について探しているって聞いて
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.72,0:15:44.25,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もしかしたら役に立つんじゃないかなって
Dialogue: 4,0:15:44.25,0:15:46.22,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ありがとうございます　鏡子さん！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:46.99,0:15:49.17,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,この中に載ってるかも　紬の歌
Dialogue: 4,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ホントですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,読めない
Dialogue: 4,0:15:54.34,0:15:56.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ドイツ語みたいね
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.26,0:15:58.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,チンプンカンプンです
Dialogue: 4,0:15:58.82,0:16:00.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちょっと見せてくれる？
Dialogue: 4,0:16:10.93,0:16:11.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,これって…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.82,0:16:14.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい　私の大好きなあの歌です！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:14.86,0:16:17.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ついに見つかったわね　紬！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:20.23,0:16:21.56,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:21.56,0:16:24.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,これじゃ　なんて歌ってるかわかりませんね
Dialogue: 4,0:16:25.46,0:16:28.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だったら　紬が歌詞を作っちゃえばいいのよ
Dialogue: 4,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.47,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私が？
Dialogue: 4,0:16:29.47,0:16:30.74,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,おもしろそうだな！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:30.74,0:16:31.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,やってみようよ
Dialogue: 4,0:16:31.70,0:16:32.46,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:32.46,0:16:35.22,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも　ちょっと難しそうです
Dialogue: 4,0:16:35.22,0:16:38.54,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,とりあえず　自分の好きなものを言っていったら？
Dialogue: 4,0:16:38.54,0:16:40.67,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,きっと紬らしい歌詞になるわ
Dialogue: 4,0:16:40.67,0:16:43.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好きなもの…　ですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:16:46.50,0:16:48.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,840,0,0,,むぎゅぎゅ…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:51.56,0:16:53.99,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ホントにホントにありがとうでした！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:53.99,0:16:55.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いえいえ
Dialogue: 4,0:16:55.02,0:16:56.85,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お役に立てて何よりよ
Dialogue: 4,0:16:56.85,0:16:58.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,また　来てください！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:58.26,0:16:58.91,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:58.91,0:17:00.57,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それじゃ　気をつけて帰ってね
Dialogue: 4,0:17:00.57,0:17:01.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ありがとうです！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:02.13,0:17:06.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パイリくん　もしも夜\寝にくかったら　ごめんなさい
Dialogue: 4,0:17:06.54,0:17:07.55,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,何のこと？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:07.55,0:17:09.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,さっきの紬のおっぱい
Dialogue: 4,0:17:09.30,0:17:13.42,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちょうどいい詰め物がなくて　パイリくんの枕を使わせてもらったの
Dialogue: 4,0:17:14.50,0:17:16.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺の　枕？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:16.67,0:17:19.36,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬の　胸に…
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.86,0:17:24.77,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,しっかりしろ！　鷹原羽依里！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:28.34,0:17:31.65,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,頑張れ　紬ヴェンダース！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:31.65,0:17:32.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:33.88,0:17:37.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,おっぱい！　水織静久！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:43.42,0:17:46.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鷹原{\alpha&HFF&\t(1350,1351,\alpha&H00&)}羽依里！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:45.73,0:17:48.65,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,1000,0,,紬ヴェンダース！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.12,0:17:50.67,Text JP - Tsumugi,,1100,0,0,,水織靜久！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:50.67,0:17:53.24,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鷹原{\alpha&HFF&\t(1190,1191,\alpha&H00&)}羽依里！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:53.24,0:17:56.10,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬ヴェンダース！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:56.10,0:17:59.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}水織靜久！
Dialogue: 4,0:18:08.78,0:18:09.77,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,怖い…
Dialogue: 4,0:18:11.11,0:18:13.65,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あっ　やっぱり鼻歌のお姉ちゃんだ！
Dialogue: 4,0:18:15.44,0:18:16.57,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,みんな…
Dialogue: 4,0:18:18.36,0:18:19.28,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい！
Dialogue: 4,0:18:23.53,0:18:26.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,シズクも一緒に来てくれればよかったのに
Dialogue: 4,0:18:26.70,0:18:28.24,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そ…　そうだな
Dialogue: 4,0:18:28.24,0:18:30.63,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今日は早く帰らなくちゃだめなの
Dialogue: 4,0:18:30.63,0:18:32.21,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あとは2人で…　ねっ！
Dialogue: 4,0:18:32.63,0:18:35.09,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なに　気を遣ってんだよ
Dialogue: 4,0:18:36.87,0:18:37.55,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 4,0:18:40.24,0:18:42.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちょっと寄っていきませんか？
Dialogue: 4,0:18:45.24,0:18:48.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬って　いつもこんな風景を見てたんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:18:48.62,0:18:49.74,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 4,0:18:49.74,0:18:52.19,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私のお気に入りの景色です
Dialogue: 4,0:19:04.52,0:19:05.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっと
Dialogue: 4,0:19:06.32,0:19:08.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ようやくできました
Dialogue: 4,0:19:08.60,0:19:09.94,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,心の準備
Dialogue: 4,0:19:10.84,0:19:12.10,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,心の準備？
Dialogue: 4,0:19:12.66,0:19:14.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あの　ですね…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:15.00,0:19:16.80,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私も好きですよ
Dialogue: 4,0:19:16.80,0:19:18.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさんのこと
Dialogue: 4,0:19:18.16,0:19:18.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ？
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.04,0:19:21.23,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好きと言ってるはずです
Dialogue: 4,0:19:21.23,0:19:23.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,楽勝で大好きだと…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:23.26,0:19:25.43,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あれは友達としてじゃ…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:25.82,0:19:27.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あのときはそうでした
Dialogue: 4,0:19:28.67,0:19:29.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも
Dialogue: 4,0:19:31.18,0:19:33.14,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,違う意味もありました
Dialogue: 4,0:19:34.21,0:19:38.12,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,「夏休みを全部やる」なんて言われたときから…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:38.12,0:19:40.10,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あんなことを言われたら
Dialogue: 4,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.32,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好きになっちゃいますよ
Dialogue: 4,0:19:42.32,0:19:45.69,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だから　ドキドキしないように
Dialogue: 4,0:19:45.69,0:19:49.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさんの前で　ず～っと普通の顔してました
Dialogue: 4,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.85,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも　全然ムリです
Dialogue: 4,0:19:52.85,0:19:55.33,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今も　ず～っとドキドキしてます
Dialogue: 4,0:19:55.57,0:19:56.52,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:57.32,0:20:00.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だけど　もうすぐ帰るので
Dialogue: 4,0:20:01.62,0:20:04.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好きって言うの
Dialogue: 4,0:20:04.08,0:20:05.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,意味ないです…
Dialogue: 4,0:20:11.35,0:20:15.54,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お別れするとき　絶対いっぱい泣いちゃいます
Dialogue: 4,0:20:16.55,0:20:20.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そんなお別れは…　嫌なんです
Dialogue: 4,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.94,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なんでですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:20:21.94,0:20:22.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なんで…
Dialogue: 4,0:20:23.68,0:20:26.87,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どうして…　言っちゃうんですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:20:32.56,0:20:34.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お別れするからって
Dialogue: 4,0:20:35.34,0:20:36.96,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,意味なくなっちゃうのかな？
Dialogue: 4,0:20:37.60,0:20:38.38,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ？
Dialogue: 4,0:20:39.08,0:20:41.42,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お別れするって…
Dialogue: 4,0:20:41.42,0:20:44.39,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もう会えなくなるってわかっても
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.39,0:20:47.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,この気持ちに意味がなくなるなんて
Dialogue: 4,0:20:47.34,0:20:48.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そんなことないと思う
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.66,0:20:51.76,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どんなつらいことがあったって
Dialogue: 4,0:20:51.76,0:20:53.66,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好きって気持ちは変わらない
Dialogue: 4,0:20:54.71,0:20:57.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それを思い出させてくれたのは　紬だよ
Dialogue: 4,0:20:58.13,0:20:59.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私が？
Dialogue: 4,0:21:00.03,0:21:00.80,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 4,0:21:01.62,0:21:04.44,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だから　やっぱりちゃんと言うよ
Dialogue: 4,0:21:05.33,0:21:07.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺は　紬が好きだ
Dialogue: 4,0:21:09.19,0:21:10.24,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさん
Dialogue: 4,0:21:10.95,0:21:12.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私もです
Dialogue: 4,0:21:16.52,0:21:19.79,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさんのことが　大好きです！
Dialogue: 4,0:21:28.41,0:21:29.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ただいま　鏡子さん！
Dialogue: 4,0:21:30.00,0:21:31.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,おかえりなさい
Dialogue: 4,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.67,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なんだかうれしそうね　羽依里くん
Dialogue: 4,0:21:35.67,0:21:37.77,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そ…　そうですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:21:44.40,0:21:45.51,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺も手伝いますよ
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.46,0:21:47.44,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あっ　すみません
Dialogue: 4,0:21:53.56,0:21:54.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬？
Dialogue: 4,0:22:02.63,0:22:09.83,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fad(0,1780)}その日　俺たちの前から　紬の姿が消えた
